./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:8373:        "rationale": "Figure 1 directly depicts the listed model-input pathway: single-cell RNA-seq profiles pass through the cell encoder to gene embeddings, then a modality adapter/projected embedding stage, and these are concatenated with instruction and prompt embeddings at the decoder interface. Under the atlas rules, the exact variant name need not appear when the same paper’s shared architecture shows the same input mechanism for the named variant. The crop is input-focused and valid for both the gene-expression conditioning route and the prompt-conditioning route.",
