./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:18807:      "no_figure_rationale": "The current crop from Extended Data Fig. 1 is invalid because it shows a truthfulness grader inside a scorer panel, which is downstream evaluation rather than target-model input. Figure 1 depicts training-data assembly and model adjustment, not the evaluation-time prompt-only route in Table 1. Figure 6 shows multimodal instruction examples with image-plus-text prompts to an LMM, which does not cleanly match the listed text-only gene function description prompt route for LLaMA2-7B (LoRA). The remaining figures are embeddings, performance plots, enrichment charts, or decorative icons, none of which provide a defensible crop of the actual model input for the stated route.",
./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:18996:      "no_figure_rationale": "The current crop from Extended Data Fig. 1 is invalid because it depicts a truthfulness grader consuming model output text during scoring, which the atlas rules exclude. Figure 1 is a high-level training workflow and does not clearly show the evaluation prompt object for this route. Figure 6 shows multimodal instruction examples with image-based tasks and answers, not the gene-function-description prompt-only route in Table 1. The remaining candidates are embeddings, performance plots, enrichment plots, decorative icons, or ablation results, none of which depict the listed actual model input. No defensible replacement is visible among the provided figures.",
./docs/input-representation-atlas/data/atlas.json:19192:      "no_figure_rationale": "The current crop from Extended Data Fig. 1 is invalid because it isolates grader/scorer content, which is evaluator-side input rather than target-model input. Figure 1 depicts training-data assembly and model development, not the evaluation prompt for this route. Figure 6 shows multimodal instruction examples for other tasks, not the gene-function-description prompt to LLaMAPro-8B. The remaining candidates are embeddings, performance plots, enrichment charts, or decorative icons, none of which provide a visible input path for the listed actual_model_input route.",
